WEBVTT

01:20.960 --> 01:26.720
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.380 --> 01:29.720
[Episode 17]

01:40.350 --> 01:41.210
Your Highness.

01:42.070 --> 01:42.870
Where is my father?

01:42.870 --> 01:43.870
The Marquis went to the military camp.

01:43.870 --> 01:44.430
What?

01:45.680 --> 01:47.120
Did he say when he'd be back?

01:47.120 --> 01:48.450
The Marquis didn't say.

01:50.070 --> 01:50.600
Let's go.

01:54.920 --> 01:55.430
Hurry.

01:55.789 --> 01:56.400
Don't let anyone know.

01:56.400 --> 01:56.759
Yes.

01:57.000 --> 01:57.560
Hold on.

01:57.440 --> 02:01.320
[A Legacy of Virtue and Grace]

02:11.150 --> 02:12.030
Let me ask you.

02:12.590 --> 02:13.430
Did you go again

02:13.430 --> 02:14.710
to see that Gu Jinzhao?

02:17.000 --> 02:18.400
How did you know, Mother?

02:29.150 --> 02:30.750
So you had someone following me

02:30.750 --> 02:32.150
these past few days?

02:32.870 --> 02:34.590
If I didn't send someone to follow you,

02:34.590 --> 02:35.190
who knows

02:35.210 --> 02:36.260
what you would do.

02:37.030 --> 02:39.280
I wanted to talk to you
about this earlier,

02:39.280 --> 02:40.680
but your sister stopped me,

02:40.680 --> 02:42.190
saying she would talk to you.

02:42.190 --> 02:43.030
But what happened?

02:43.030 --> 02:44.430
You didn't listen at all.

02:46.370 --> 02:47.560
You brazenly

02:47.560 --> 02:49.160
went to a young lady's house.

02:49.360 --> 02:50.560
That eldest Miss Gu

02:51.079 --> 02:52.360
really lacks manners.

02:52.960 --> 02:54.840
She actually let you into her manor.

02:54.840 --> 02:56.590
The family discipline of the Gu Manor

02:56.590 --> 02:57.710
is evident.

02:59.360 --> 03:00.220
Let me tell you,

03:01.190 --> 03:03.240
you are not allowed to see her again.

03:03.870 --> 03:05.000
From today onwards,

03:05.360 --> 03:06.410
you will obediently

03:06.410 --> 03:07.470
copy books at home.

03:07.630 --> 03:08.960
Without my permission,

03:08.960 --> 03:10.890
you are not allowed to go anywhere.

03:14.100 --> 03:14.840
That's fine.

03:16.060 --> 03:18.520
I wanted to practice
my handwriting anyway.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.360
Li Xianhuai,

03:20.240 --> 03:21.150
go find me some

03:21.150 --> 03:22.410
excellent copybooks.

03:23.360 --> 03:23.750
Yes.

03:28.470 --> 03:29.280
Mr. Xiao.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.190
Madam.

03:32.000 --> 03:34.200
The Marquis went to the main camp today.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.960
There are many affairs in the manor.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.560
I have no way

03:36.560 --> 03:37.960
to keep a close eye on him.

03:38.360 --> 03:39.630
You are Xian's master.

03:40.079 --> 03:41.190
I will have to trouble you

03:41.190 --> 03:42.320
to keep an eye on him.

03:43.800 --> 03:44.960
Yes, Madam.

03:52.430 --> 03:55.710
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

04:09.180 --> 04:10.510
That's the death knell.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.880
Could it be that His Majesty...

04:26.130 --> 04:27.980
The moment has finally come.

04:29.200 --> 04:31.390
In the autumn of
the 35th year of Jingning,

04:31.390 --> 04:33.730
His Majesty passed away.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.040
From the palace to the common folk,

04:35.040 --> 04:36.920
the entire nation shall observe mourning.

04:36.920 --> 04:37.750
From today on,

04:38.240 --> 04:40.040
the capital is under
curfew and martial law.

04:40.040 --> 04:42.240
Strict checks will be
carried out at all city gates.

04:42.240 --> 04:44.040
No entry or exit without orders.

04:49.300 --> 04:50.490
His Majesty has passed away.

04:50.490 --> 04:51.750
I need to enter the palace.

04:51.750 --> 04:53.200
Madam has already entered the palace.

04:53.200 --> 04:54.710
Before leaving, she specially instructed

04:54.710 --> 04:56.270
that she asked for sick leave for you.

04:56.270 --> 04:57.680
Please stay in the mansion.

04:57.680 --> 04:58.409
Do not leave.

05:01.670 --> 05:03.710
Our household must keep
a low profile these next few days.

05:02.270 --> 05:03.510
[Blessings Passed Down for Generations]

05:03.800 --> 05:05.360
Purchasing will change from once a day

05:05.360 --> 05:06.630
to once every three days.

05:06.630 --> 05:08.030
If anyone needs to go out,

05:08.430 --> 05:09.920
come to me to get a token.

05:10.510 --> 05:11.480
Without a token,

05:11.870 --> 05:14.470
no one is allowed to
go out without permission.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.390
Yes.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.800
My Lady, Guard Li is here.

05:19.680 --> 05:20.310
Miss Gu.

05:20.680 --> 05:21.580
Madam has gone to the palace.

05:21.580 --> 05:22.750
His Highness is afraid
of alerting Xiao You

05:22.750 --> 05:24.010
and doesn't dare to force his way out.

05:24.010 --> 05:26.070
We have to rely on you to think of a way.

05:27.360 --> 05:28.310
The Third Master

05:28.720 --> 05:30.920
has probably entered the palace by now.

05:38.270 --> 05:39.390
As you expected,

05:39.420 --> 05:40.750
the Shenji Battalion has indeed

05:40.750 --> 05:42.159
been making unusual moves
these past few days.

05:42.159 --> 05:43.750
Not only have they
been drilling repeatedly,

05:43.750 --> 05:44.750
but yesterday the Ministry of War

05:44.750 --> 05:45.560
also transported inside

05:45.560 --> 05:47.159
ten full carts of gunpowder.

05:47.920 --> 05:48.980
Then it all adds up.

05:50.870 --> 05:52.040
On the surface,

05:52.680 --> 05:54.190
Prince Ruichang is planning a rebellion,

05:54.190 --> 05:55.040
but in reality,

05:55.040 --> 05:57.330
my mentor is intentionally indulging him.

05:57.330 --> 05:58.860
He is using Prince Ruichang

05:58.920 --> 06:00.810
to drag Marquis Changxing into this.

06:00.810 --> 06:02.440
So you mean...

06:05.430 --> 06:07.760
Prince Ruichang is planning a rebellion.

06:08.070 --> 06:09.750
His only chance is

06:10.120 --> 06:12.140
the moment His Majesty passes away.

06:12.270 --> 06:14.470
With just the few mansion guards he has,

06:15.040 --> 06:16.120
to start a rebellion,

06:16.120 --> 06:17.780
he can only do it in the palace.

06:18.340 --> 06:19.430
Once he makes a move,

06:19.430 --> 06:20.490
Marquis Changxing

06:20.630 --> 06:22.120
will definitely enter the palace

06:22.120 --> 06:24.920
to protect the Emperor
and suppress the rebellion.

06:24.920 --> 06:26.390
But between these two sides,

06:26.390 --> 06:27.650
whoever wins in the end

06:28.630 --> 06:29.510
could never be

06:29.510 --> 06:31.370
a match for the Shenji Battalion.

06:50.370 --> 06:51.050
Mentor.

06:54.430 --> 06:56.000
Your only task today

06:56.050 --> 06:57.720
is to protect the Crown Prince.

06:57.720 --> 06:59.159
Even if you die,

06:59.870 --> 07:01.870
you must keep the Crown Prince safe.

07:02.000 --> 07:02.820
I

07:03.000 --> 07:04.260
guarantee with my life

07:04.270 --> 07:05.870
to protect the Crown Prince.

07:06.190 --> 07:07.390
Besides, Mentor, you have

07:07.390 --> 07:09.050
already made a thorough plan.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.490
The Crown Prince

07:10.920 --> 07:12.320
will definitely be fine.

07:13.270 --> 07:14.390
His Majesty has passed away.

07:14.390 --> 07:16.360
The Crown Prince will mourn at the bier.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.360
Prince Ruichang

07:17.430 --> 07:18.630
must also be present.

07:19.510 --> 07:21.240
We cannot afford any mistakes.

07:21.680 --> 07:22.240
Yes.

07:24.190 --> 07:24.800
Mentor.

07:25.830 --> 07:27.310
What about Marquis Changxing?

07:27.310 --> 07:29.240
You don't need to worry about that.

07:29.720 --> 07:31.830
The Shenji Battalion will take them down

07:31.830 --> 07:33.630
and confirm their treason.

07:40.200 --> 07:43.770
[The Reform of Land and Taxation]

07:45.480 --> 07:46.070
That day,

07:47.000 --> 07:49.950
when my mentor wrote
this The Reform of Land and Taxation,

07:49.950 --> 07:50.830
I just felt

07:51.310 --> 07:52.970
a surge of emotion in my chest.

07:53.000 --> 07:55.400
If Great Yan is to become
strong and reform,

07:56.000 --> 07:57.680
it must have someone like my mentor,

07:57.680 --> 07:59.510
with great wisdom and courage,

07:59.510 --> 08:00.920
to manage and direct.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.780
But what about now?

08:05.430 --> 08:07.800
Maritime transport is indeed profitable.

08:07.800 --> 08:09.270
But to develop it,

08:09.270 --> 08:11.190
deliberately leaving
the river embankments unrepaired,

08:11.190 --> 08:12.630
is this for the court and the people,

08:12.630 --> 08:14.160
or for partisan struggles?

08:16.370 --> 08:22.690
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

08:16.680 --> 08:17.940
Marquis Changxing...

08:18.270 --> 08:18.870
Marquis Changxing

08:18.870 --> 08:20.800
indeed opposes the new tax policy.

08:21.240 --> 08:22.920
But to ignore the risks of war,

08:23.270 --> 08:25.270
doing everything to bring him down,

08:25.680 --> 08:27.320
is this for the sake of the country,

08:27.320 --> 08:29.510
or for personal gain?

08:37.600 --> 08:38.400
Third Master,

08:39.320 --> 08:40.270
hold on.

08:41.669 --> 08:44.400
Even if Marquis Changxing
has countless faults,

08:44.720 --> 08:45.320
just the fact

08:45.320 --> 08:47.240
that he can deter the barbarians

08:47.960 --> 08:49.720
is enough for me

08:49.740 --> 08:51.270
to protect him with my life.

08:56.060 --> 09:02.220
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

08:59.000 --> 08:59.750
Otherwise,

09:00.590 --> 09:02.650
if war breaks out at the border again,

09:02.670 --> 09:03.800
how can we talk about

09:03.840 --> 09:05.390
maritime transport and river repairs?

09:05.390 --> 09:08.360
Equalized land and lower taxes
will be nothing but empty promises.

09:08.360 --> 09:09.510
Third Master.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.870
This is a dead end.

09:13.760 --> 09:16.020
Prince Ruichang will inevitably rebel.

09:16.240 --> 09:18.600
Marquis Changxing will also
surely quell the rebellion.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.790
The Shenji Battalion

09:19.790 --> 09:21.920
is directly under the Ministry of War,

09:21.960 --> 09:23.890
obeying only the Grand Secretary.

09:24.750 --> 09:26.000
How can you save him?

09:27.950 --> 09:29.950
Even if you save Marquis Changxing,

09:30.720 --> 09:32.150
if the Grand Secretary finds out

09:32.150 --> 09:33.360
about your actions,

09:34.870 --> 09:36.550
everything will be over.

09:38.480 --> 09:41.280
I'm afraid you won't
even be able to save your life.

09:51.840 --> 09:53.360
So in this situation,

09:56.790 --> 09:59.190
not only must I protect Marquis Changxing,

10:00.320 --> 10:02.050
but I must also protect myself.

10:31.720 --> 10:32.380
Be careful.

10:33.200 --> 10:34.910
It's the Marquis's Black Armor Army.

10:34.910 --> 10:37.310
They seem to be
heading towards the palace.

10:38.870 --> 10:40.200
Let's hurry up.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.560
Hyah!

10:44.360 --> 10:44.840
Hyah!

10:47.960 --> 10:48.620
Fifth Aunt.

10:49.030 --> 10:49.760
Eldest Miss.

10:50.030 --> 10:51.200
In such chaotic times,

10:51.200 --> 10:52.130
why are you here?

10:53.350 --> 10:54.230
And you too?

10:54.440 --> 10:55.270
Eldest Miss,

10:55.510 --> 10:56.720
the Marquis went to the military camp.

10:56.720 --> 10:58.080
His Highness has been confined by Madam.

10:58.080 --> 10:59.200
He can't leave the mansion.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.600
I really had no other way,

11:00.600 --> 11:02.060
so I asked Miss Gu for help.

11:02.480 --> 11:04.510
My Lady! My Lady!

11:05.240 --> 11:05.670
My Lady.

11:05.670 --> 11:06.570
Hui.

11:06.840 --> 11:08.480
Hui had a bump while being changed.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.680
She's crying for you.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.360
Hui has a high fever.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.720
Quick, fetch a physician.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.440
Yes.

11:19.700 --> 11:20.360
It's fine.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.230
Go on.

11:21.510 --> 11:22.170
Fifth Aunt,

11:22.190 --> 11:23.600
do you know Young Master Ye's master,

11:23.600 --> 11:24.150
Xiao You?

11:24.320 --> 11:25.030
Of course.

11:25.550 --> 11:27.080
But his real name is Xiao Qishan.

11:27.080 --> 11:29.390
He was a strategist
for the late Prince Chengqing.

11:29.390 --> 11:30.520
How do you know that?

11:30.600 --> 11:31.840
The Ji family's business spans the world,

11:31.840 --> 11:33.480
so we naturally have our channels.

11:33.480 --> 11:34.960
This person is secretly colluding

11:34.960 --> 11:36.170
with Prince Ruichang.

11:36.170 --> 11:37.980
Prince Ruichang has always brooded over

11:37.980 --> 11:39.600
the death of Prince Chengqing.

11:39.600 --> 11:40.480
With His Majesty's passing,

11:40.480 --> 11:41.480
Prince Ruichang is very likely

11:41.480 --> 11:43.440
to start a rebellion
during the national mourning.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.890
If they succeed in their revolt,

11:44.890 --> 11:46.550
given their hatred for the Marquis,

11:46.550 --> 11:48.550
they definitely won't spare
Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

11:48.550 --> 11:49.690
But right now, only Young Master Ye

11:49.690 --> 11:50.770
has the token to enter the palace.

11:50.770 --> 11:51.840
We must ask Young Master Ye

11:51.840 --> 11:53.440
to quickly warn the Marquis.

11:53.550 --> 11:54.150
Remember,

11:54.600 --> 11:55.800
don't alert Xiao You.

11:59.120 --> 12:00.250
Hui has a high fever.

12:00.270 --> 12:01.440
The streets are full of soldiers.

12:01.440 --> 12:03.150
The physicians outside refuse to come out.

12:03.150 --> 12:03.840
My lady is

12:03.840 --> 12:04.720
so worried,

12:04.910 --> 12:06.140
that's why we came to invite you.

12:06.140 --> 12:07.090
No problem.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.050
Young Master,

12:20.050 --> 12:21.710
Miss Gu said the streets
are being cleared,

12:21.710 --> 12:23.030
and carriages are too slow.
Afraid we wouldn't make it,

12:23.030 --> 12:24.760
she had me bring her horse over.

12:25.970 --> 12:26.770
Young Master,

12:26.980 --> 12:28.240
hold the reins tightly.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.960
Miss Gu also asked me to tell you

12:29.960 --> 12:30.760
to be careful.

12:31.510 --> 12:31.920
Hyah!

12:35.320 --> 12:36.510
Kneel.

12:35.440 --> 12:39.200
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

12:39.040 --> 12:40.760
First bow.

12:42.840 --> 12:43.870
Rise.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.120
Stand.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.790
Kneel.

13:06.030 --> 13:07.670
Second bow.

13:09.630 --> 13:10.750
Rise.

13:12.600 --> 13:14.440
Third bow.

13:15.180 --> 13:19.340
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

13:16.910 --> 13:18.030
Your Majesty!

13:18.440 --> 13:19.440
Your Majesty!

13:20.240 --> 13:21.080
Ye Xian.

13:23.790 --> 13:24.650
Your Highness!

13:24.840 --> 13:25.700
Your Highness!

13:26.030 --> 13:27.890
Summon the Imperial Physicians!

13:28.030 --> 13:29.080
Take him to the side hall.

13:29.080 --> 13:29.880
Your Majesty!

13:30.720 --> 13:31.580
Your Highness!

13:31.600 --> 13:32.370
Your Majesty!

13:32.370 --> 13:33.250
Your Majesty!

13:33.840 --> 13:34.960
Your Majesty!

13:35.870 --> 13:37.240
Your Majesty!

13:41.320 --> 13:41.870
Mentor,

13:42.270 --> 13:43.630
I'll go check on the Crown Prince.

13:43.630 --> 13:45.120
The palace gates are heavily guarded.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.780
How did Young Master Ye get in?

13:48.390 --> 13:49.840
Just now in the Eastern Palace,

13:49.840 --> 13:51.390
His Highness the Crown Prince told me

13:51.390 --> 13:53.720
he had an appointment
with Young Master Ye.

13:53.720 --> 13:54.520
Your Majesty.

13:54.840 --> 13:55.480
Go.

13:56.120 --> 13:56.600
Yes.

14:08.650 --> 14:13.160
[Uphold Rites and Elucidate Doctrines]

14:10.960 --> 14:13.300
His Highness is young and weak after all.

14:13.750 --> 14:15.750
He didn't eat
a single grain for breakfast,

14:15.750 --> 14:17.240
with all this grief and exhaustion,

14:17.240 --> 14:18.480
he couldn't hold on.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.910
Then please write
a prescription, Director Wu.

14:20.910 --> 14:21.480
Yes.

14:25.190 --> 14:28.770
[Uphold Rites and Elucidate Doctrines]

14:33.150 --> 14:34.670
The late emperor has passed away.

14:34.670 --> 14:36.670
Your Highness must be heartbroken.

14:37.120 --> 14:37.670
However,

14:38.240 --> 14:41.570
Your Highness shoulders
the responsibility of the nation.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.440
Please, Your Highness,

14:43.440 --> 14:44.840
take care of your health.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.200
I understand.

14:48.030 --> 14:49.030
Everyone, leave.

14:49.630 --> 14:50.270
I

14:50.550 --> 14:52.080
want some peace and quiet.

14:54.790 --> 14:55.720
Young Master Ye,

14:55.910 --> 14:57.510
you should go guard outside.

14:59.790 --> 15:01.360
Why should I listen to you?

15:02.720 --> 15:04.780
I will stay and protect His Highness.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.930
Then, Young Master Ye,

15:09.200 --> 15:11.330
you should definitely guard outside.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.950
If anything happens,

15:13.080 --> 15:15.010
you can charge to the front, right?

15:35.490 --> 15:38.710
[Uphold Rites and Elucidate Doctrines]

16:10.790 --> 16:12.080
Your Majesty!

16:13.550 --> 16:15.030
Your Majesty!

16:15.750 --> 16:16.500
There are rebels!

16:16.500 --> 16:17.740
Protect the Crown Prince!

16:17.410 --> 16:19.990
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

16:20.150 --> 16:21.150
Arrest them all!

16:33.660 --> 16:36.070
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

16:42.470 --> 16:43.700
Li Qi,

16:45.120 --> 16:47.320
your day has finally come.

16:49.590 --> 16:53.800
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

16:52.120 --> 16:55.410
Your day has finally come!

17:00.080 --> 17:00.810
Ram the door!

17:04.980 --> 17:05.980
Pry the door open!

17:32.200 --> 17:33.550
Traitor!

17:34.090 --> 17:35.120
How impudent!

17:37.870 --> 17:39.660
Old fool.

17:40.540 --> 17:42.590
Are you tired of living?

17:43.400 --> 17:43.920
You...

17:49.150 --> 17:51.170
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

18:15.650 --> 18:16.640
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

18:19.250 --> 18:20.580
The Shenji Battalion.

18:33.200 --> 18:34.070
Ye Guangsheng!

18:34.590 --> 18:35.750
Taking advantage
of His Majesty's passing,

18:35.750 --> 18:36.740
you led troops into the palace

18:36.740 --> 18:37.960
with the intent to rebel.

18:37.960 --> 18:38.980
Do you plead guilty?

18:38.980 --> 18:40.880
I entered the palace
to protect His Majesty.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.000
You stopped me.

18:42.640 --> 18:44.100
What are your intentions?

18:45.640 --> 18:46.500
Fu Hailian.

18:47.830 --> 18:48.440
You...

18:48.920 --> 18:49.830
Li Zhi.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.210
Did you really think

18:52.550 --> 18:54.110
your childish attempt

18:54.880 --> 18:56.570
to usurp the throne

18:56.750 --> 18:57.960
would succeed?

19:00.430 --> 19:02.230
Before His Majesty passed away,

19:02.240 --> 19:03.970
you secretly gathered troops.

19:04.000 --> 19:05.680
Yet you claim you have
no intention of rebelling?

19:05.680 --> 19:06.510
Take him down!

19:12.470 --> 19:14.090
Protect the Marquis!

19:17.790 --> 19:18.590
Yun Tao.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.900
Order your men right now

19:21.240 --> 19:22.840
to surrender their weapons.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.350
I promise you

19:24.750 --> 19:26.880
I won't implicate your entire family.

19:31.550 --> 19:33.590
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

21:08.500 --> 21:09.430
Young Master Ye.

21:09.750 --> 21:11.800
As long as you are willing
to protect the new emperor

21:11.800 --> 21:13.770
with your life,

21:13.820 --> 21:15.420
the claim of the Marquis' rebellion

21:15.420 --> 21:16.710
will be debunked.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.230
Report.

21:25.790 --> 21:26.550
Your Highness,

21:26.550 --> 21:27.510
Grand Secretary.

21:27.510 --> 21:29.350
Ye Guangsheng, Marquis Changxing,
disobeyed orders

21:29.350 --> 21:30.960
and led 3,000 Black Armor
from the Capital Garrison

21:30.960 --> 21:31.920
to break into the palace

21:31.920 --> 21:32.790
to rebel.

21:34.160 --> 21:35.440
This is impossible.

21:38.680 --> 21:39.510
How is this possible?

21:39.510 --> 21:40.680
This is impossible.

21:40.790 --> 21:41.990
How is this possible?

21:45.640 --> 21:46.470
How dare you!

22:11.750 --> 22:13.690
Ye Xian risked
his life to save me.

22:13.750 --> 22:15.310
How dare you say the Marquis Changxing
is plotting a rebellion?

22:15.310 --> 22:16.830
That is absolute nonsense!

22:16.830 --> 22:17.510
Exactly.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.920
Even though that boy was just a double,

22:19.920 --> 22:21.750
I saw it clearly.

22:22.200 --> 22:22.880
Ye Xian

22:22.620 --> 22:24.190
[Empress Wu]

22:22.880 --> 22:25.610
risked his life, trying to
save the Crown Prince.

22:27.750 --> 22:28.640
Mr. Fu.

22:31.070 --> 22:32.200
Perhaps it's

22:32.880 --> 22:34.110
a misunderstanding.

22:34.960 --> 22:36.160
Marquis Changxing

22:37.310 --> 22:38.370
could not possibly

22:39.790 --> 22:40.590
rebel.

22:50.200 --> 22:51.070
Ye Xian!

22:52.920 --> 22:53.680
Save him now!

22:53.890 --> 22:54.830
Imperial Physicians!

22:54.830 --> 22:55.830
-Call the Imperial Physicians!
-Call the Imperial Physicians!

22:55.830 --> 22:58.160
-Call the Imperial Physicians!
-Ye Xian!

23:05.510 --> 23:06.160
My Lord.

23:06.670 --> 23:07.720
Father!

23:08.480 --> 23:09.590
-My Lord.
-Father!

23:09.720 --> 23:10.780
-My Lord.
-Father!

23:11.030 --> 23:11.550
Father!

23:12.110 --> 23:13.000
-My Lord!
-Father!

23:13.000 --> 23:13.720
My Lord!

23:13.790 --> 23:14.310
Father!

23:16.160 --> 23:16.880
Xian.

23:17.310 --> 23:19.010
I only suffered minor injuries.

23:19.010 --> 23:19.480
Madam.

23:19.640 --> 23:21.480
It is more urgent to treat

23:21.480 --> 23:22.870
the Marquis and Young Master Ye.

23:22.870 --> 23:23.350
Father.

23:23.350 --> 23:24.550
Quick, save them!

23:24.640 --> 23:25.890
Save them, quick!

23:25.910 --> 23:27.160
-What are you waiting for?
-Father!

23:27.160 --> 23:28.200
Help!

23:28.590 --> 23:30.350
-Father!
-My Lord.

23:30.370 --> 23:31.130
My Lord!

23:39.030 --> 23:40.830
The Marquis is very fortunate.

23:41.030 --> 23:43.420
That shot to the chest missed by an inch,

23:43.880 --> 23:45.640
and didn't damage his heart or lungs.

23:45.640 --> 23:48.170
The injury to his leg
is actually more severe.

23:48.200 --> 23:49.960
I will write two prescriptions.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.310
One to draw out the poison,

23:51.310 --> 23:52.880
and one to nourish the blood.

23:52.880 --> 23:54.820
If his fever breaks in three days,

23:55.030 --> 23:56.880
his life will be saved.

23:59.030 --> 24:00.560
Thank you for your trouble.

24:30.000 --> 24:33.140
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

24:33.480 --> 24:34.280
Third Master.

24:51.400 --> 24:52.460
At a time like this,

24:52.720 --> 24:54.380
you shouldn't have come to me.

24:54.550 --> 24:55.720
You did this,

24:56.200 --> 24:57.070
didn't you?

24:58.550 --> 25:00.590
Zhou Kuohai, Commander
of the Shenji Battalion,

25:00.590 --> 25:01.440
from the very beginning,

25:01.440 --> 25:02.900
has been Fu Hailian's man.

25:03.110 --> 25:04.640
Under Fu Hailian's orders,

25:04.750 --> 25:06.680
he intentionally injured my father,

25:06.680 --> 25:08.210
and framed him for treason.

25:08.590 --> 25:09.830
Using the Prince Ruichang's rebellion,

25:09.830 --> 25:11.350
the one who wanted to get rid of my father

25:11.350 --> 25:12.880
has always been Fu Hailian.

25:13.680 --> 25:14.400
And as

25:14.400 --> 25:15.920
Fu Hailian's top student,

25:16.350 --> 25:18.810
you couldn't have
been unaware of this plot.

25:21.880 --> 25:22.510
What?

25:23.590 --> 25:24.790
Speechless?

25:26.200 --> 25:27.860
If you really want me to speak,

25:28.350 --> 25:29.480
then I will.

25:30.350 --> 25:31.550
What do you think

25:31.680 --> 25:32.680
my relationship with

25:32.680 --> 25:33.830
your mansion is?

25:34.320 --> 25:35.350
What is the relationship

25:35.350 --> 25:36.810
between Fu Hailian and me?

25:38.030 --> 25:39.510
Do you apparently think

25:39.750 --> 25:40.680
that I must

25:40.750 --> 25:42.070
betray my mentor

25:42.160 --> 25:43.790
to help your mansion?

25:45.140 --> 25:46.590
Passing you the message

25:46.720 --> 25:48.270
and thinking of a way
to break the deadlock for you

25:48.270 --> 25:48.960
is already the absolute maximum

25:48.960 --> 25:50.030
I can do to help

25:50.110 --> 25:51.830
Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

25:51.830 --> 25:53.070
And as for these things,

25:53.070 --> 25:54.600
who was supposed to do them?

25:54.860 --> 25:55.750
As the only heir

25:55.750 --> 25:57.810
of the Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

25:58.240 --> 25:59.880
you spend your days playing around,

25:59.880 --> 26:01.270
ignorant and incompetent.

26:01.270 --> 26:02.110
Now that the Marquis Changxing's Mansion

26:02.110 --> 26:03.550
is on the verge of destruction,

26:03.550 --> 26:04.680
you can only seek help

26:04.680 --> 26:05.920
from an outsider like me.

26:05.920 --> 26:07.190
Why don't you reflect on

26:07.190 --> 26:08.250
your own problems?

26:08.510 --> 26:10.000
What kind of solution is yours?

26:10.000 --> 26:11.070
My father is severely injured

26:11.070 --> 26:11.720
and on the brink of death.

26:11.720 --> 26:13.920
At least the Marquis Changxing's Mansion
is still standing.

26:13.920 --> 26:15.450
The Marquis is still alive,

26:15.980 --> 26:17.070
and so are you.

26:32.350 --> 26:34.920
The Crown Prince
is about to ascend the throne.

26:34.920 --> 26:35.920
You had better

26:35.920 --> 26:37.450
go back and think carefully

26:38.240 --> 26:39.770
about what position to seek

26:40.160 --> 26:43.020
and how to revive
the Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

26:44.750 --> 26:45.350
Chen Yi,

26:46.000 --> 26:47.000
see the guest out.

26:57.350 --> 26:58.030
The entire street
of Prince Ruichang's Mansion

26:58.030 --> 26:59.480
has been blocked off.

27:00.030 --> 27:00.960
I even went over there today

27:00.960 --> 27:01.760
to take a look.

27:02.030 --> 27:02.790
Goodness.

27:02.920 --> 27:03.880
It was full of imperial guards,

27:03.880 --> 27:05.080
a massive dark crowd.

27:05.110 --> 27:06.460
You are really bold.

27:06.640 --> 27:08.770
I saw a lot of people going over to look.

27:08.880 --> 27:09.960
And I also heard

27:10.110 --> 27:12.590
that Prince Ruichang's
entire family will be executed.

27:12.590 --> 27:13.790
What do you mean
execute his entire family?

27:13.790 --> 27:16.500
Prince Ruichang is
the late emperor's own brother.

27:16.500 --> 27:18.280
[The Fragrant Brocade Pavilion]

27:16.880 --> 27:17.410
Who is it?

27:20.070 --> 27:20.880
It's me.

27:22.590 --> 27:23.520
Your Highness?

27:23.790 --> 27:24.880
Why are you here?

27:28.130 --> 27:31.250
[The Fragrant Brocade Pavilion]

27:32.200 --> 27:33.000
Zhao.

27:39.030 --> 27:39.640
Ye Xian.

27:47.080 --> 27:48.390
When I was young,

27:49.070 --> 27:50.270
I didn't like to talk,

27:51.110 --> 27:52.350
and I hated going out.

27:54.030 --> 27:55.890
My master would go to the mountain

27:56.350 --> 27:57.880
and catch leopard cats and baby hares

27:57.880 --> 27:58.940
for me to play with.

27:59.830 --> 28:01.690
He could also weave grasshoppers

28:01.750 --> 28:02.750
and dragonflies.

28:03.920 --> 28:05.200
In the summer,

28:06.070 --> 28:07.270
he picked hawthorns from the mountain

28:07.270 --> 28:09.130
to make candied hawthorns for me.

28:09.880 --> 28:11.880
He took me to the river to catch fish.

28:13.200 --> 28:14.350
The river crabs he found

28:14.350 --> 28:15.660
under the stones

28:15.920 --> 28:17.850
were only the size of a copper coin,

28:18.070 --> 28:19.800
but they were delicious fried.

28:22.550 --> 28:24.160
Once, I was bitten by a snake.

28:25.070 --> 28:26.270
He was very anxious.

28:27.240 --> 28:28.250
I had never seen him

28:28.250 --> 28:29.310
so anxious before.

28:30.400 --> 28:32.930
He sucked the poison out
for me with his mouth.

28:34.270 --> 28:36.130
But I killed him with my own hands.

29:12.900 --> 29:14.080
Let me ask you.

29:16.510 --> 29:17.880
Have you ever truly

29:19.680 --> 29:21.070
treated me as your disciple

29:21.070 --> 29:21.960
at all?

29:26.200 --> 29:27.640
For the last time,

29:30.790 --> 29:31.920
I will not

29:33.790 --> 29:34.720
lie to you.

29:47.440 --> 29:48.550
Actually,

29:52.030 --> 29:53.790
you have always been

29:56.920 --> 29:58.340
a pawn.

30:24.750 --> 30:26.010
Thinking about it now,

30:27.590 --> 30:29.070
his kindness to me

30:29.960 --> 30:31.200
was all for a purpose.

30:33.920 --> 30:35.000
He was afraid of losing

30:35.000 --> 30:36.350
my father's favor.

30:41.440 --> 30:42.960
And I was naive enough

30:45.960 --> 30:47.750
to think he was truly good to me.

31:02.270 --> 31:04.200
Thank you for helping me this time.

31:07.790 --> 31:09.450
Have a drink with me, will you?

31:10.610 --> 31:12.100
But you're injured.

31:12.440 --> 31:13.810
How can you drink?

31:14.680 --> 31:15.440
Then,

31:16.480 --> 31:17.200
you drink

31:18.030 --> 31:18.890
and I'll watch.

31:19.640 --> 31:21.500
It'll be like drinking it myself.

31:24.070 --> 31:24.680
Okay.

31:34.960 --> 31:35.750
Gu Jinzhao.

31:36.400 --> 31:37.030
Thank you.

31:38.000 --> 31:40.030
If you hadn't risked your life
to deliver the message,

31:40.030 --> 31:41.680
the Marquis Changxing's Mansion

31:41.680 --> 31:43.000
would be doomed by now.

31:43.920 --> 31:44.750
Gu Jinzhao.

31:45.240 --> 31:45.960
I thought

31:45.980 --> 31:47.840
that besides my blood relatives,

31:48.350 --> 31:49.070
no one else in this world

31:49.070 --> 31:50.670
would risk their life for me.

31:51.680 --> 31:52.480
Rest assured.

31:53.160 --> 31:55.690
Since you are willing
to risk your life for me,

31:55.750 --> 31:57.590
I will also repay you with mine.

32:00.260 --> 32:01.850
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

32:02.650 --> 32:05.520
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

32:08.040 --> 32:09.160
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

32:10.070 --> 32:12.820
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

32:15.820 --> 32:16.920
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

32:18.230 --> 32:21.250
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

32:22.330 --> 32:28.590
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart♪

32:29.380 --> 32:32.290
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

32:33.240 --> 32:35.970
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

32:37.000 --> 32:40.000
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

32:40.840 --> 32:43.250
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

32:44.880 --> 32:47.660
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

32:48.650 --> 32:51.730
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

32:52.490 --> 33:01.760
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

33:17.590 --> 33:20.750
By the grace of Heaven,
the Emperor proclaims:

33:20.950 --> 33:22.880
Fu Hailian is a pillar of the state.

33:22.880 --> 33:24.980
He is promoted
to Grand Secretary of the Zhongji Hall

33:24.980 --> 33:26.730
and Grand Preceptor of the Crown Prince.

33:26.730 --> 33:29.750
Vice Minister of the Crown Prince's
Household, Chen Yanyun,

33:29.750 --> 33:31.530
is promoted to
Left Vice Minister of Revenue

33:31.530 --> 33:33.810
and Grand Secretary
of the Eastern Cabinet.

33:33.810 --> 33:37.000
Marquis Changxing is rewarded
for his meritorious service to the throne

33:37.000 --> 33:38.920
with 300 taels of gold,

33:39.000 --> 33:40.510
3,000 notes of paper money,

33:40.510 --> 33:42.560
and 30 bolts of patterned silk.

33:42.730 --> 33:44.680
The heir of Marquis Changxing, Ye Xian,

33:44.680 --> 33:45.920
is rewarded for his meritorious service
in rescuing the Emperor

33:45.920 --> 33:47.760
with 100 taels of gold

33:47.790 --> 33:49.160
and 1,000 notes of paper money.

33:48.890 --> 33:50.730
[New Emperor, Shengde Emperor]

33:49.160 --> 33:50.880
He is also promoted
to the primary fifth rank

33:50.880 --> 33:52.590
as a Commander
of the Penal Court.

33:52.590 --> 33:54.680
Long live

33:54.790 --> 33:56.260
Your

33:56.510 --> 33:58.750
Majesty!

34:01.520 --> 34:05.210
[The Emperor Sets the Ultimate Principle]

34:10.380 --> 34:12.570
[Wenyuan Pavilion]

34:10.920 --> 34:12.320
You had His Majesty

34:12.340 --> 34:13.440
feign fainting while mourning,

34:13.440 --> 34:15.170
then switched in a substitute.

34:15.190 --> 34:16.040
That way,

34:16.230 --> 34:18.420
you made Prince Ruichang feel

34:18.510 --> 34:20.440
that His Majesty was still present,

34:20.440 --> 34:22.440
while also protecting His Majesty.

34:22.630 --> 34:24.150
What a masterstroke!

34:24.510 --> 34:26.600
I merely came up with the idea.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.290
The success of this plan

34:28.360 --> 34:31.360
relies entirely on His Majesty's
outstanding courage.

34:31.360 --> 34:33.030
Knowing full well
that a powerful enemy was near,

34:33.030 --> 34:34.480
he remained composed

34:35.480 --> 34:36.880
and used himself as bait.

34:37.000 --> 34:38.060
His Majesty is also

34:38.110 --> 34:40.110
trusting you more and more, Mentor.

34:40.190 --> 34:41.400
Wholeheartedly

34:41.510 --> 34:42.969
and without reservation.

34:45.909 --> 34:48.310
Marquis Changxing is severely injured.

34:49.630 --> 34:51.150
The returned imperial physician said

34:51.150 --> 34:53.280
he'll have to lie in bed for half a year.

34:54.630 --> 34:55.590
I doubt he'll ever

34:55.590 --> 34:57.360
be able to ride a horse again.

34:58.550 --> 35:01.280
At least the position
of commander of the Capital Garrison

35:01.280 --> 35:02.920
is now vacant.

35:05.110 --> 35:07.550
Marquis Changxing was lucky this time.

35:08.280 --> 35:09.690
Who would have thought Ye Xian

35:09.690 --> 35:10.750
would risk his life

35:11.000 --> 35:12.130
to save His Majesty?

35:12.880 --> 35:13.590
It shows

35:13.960 --> 35:15.440
he has extraordinary courage.

35:15.440 --> 35:18.230
That is exactly what I am worried about.

35:18.630 --> 35:19.880
Now His Majesty

35:20.000 --> 35:22.590
listens to Ye Xian

35:22.710 --> 35:24.070
and trusts him completely.

35:24.070 --> 35:25.920
Look, he wanted to join

35:26.880 --> 35:28.110
the Penal Court,

35:28.920 --> 35:31.670
and His Majesty immediately
made him a Commander.

35:31.670 --> 35:32.840
It must have been

35:33.440 --> 35:35.100
Ye Xian's own idea to go there.

35:35.280 --> 35:37.510
Feeling he couldn't go to the battlefield

35:37.510 --> 35:38.550
or achieve glory,

35:39.180 --> 35:41.340
he wanted to stay in the Penal Court.

35:43.760 --> 35:44.590
Actually, this played right

35:44.590 --> 35:46.480
into His Majesty's hands.

35:48.230 --> 35:49.440
Back then,

35:49.710 --> 35:52.240
the late Emperor established
the Penal Court

35:52.670 --> 35:56.280
to supervise officials independently
of the Three Judicial Offices.

35:56.280 --> 35:58.360
It answered only to the late Emperor,

35:59.320 --> 36:01.110
and had immense power.

36:01.960 --> 36:04.290
Later, the rebellion of Prince Chengqing

36:04.360 --> 36:05.960
implicated the Penal Court.

36:06.320 --> 36:08.980
The late Emperor intentionally
suppressed it,

36:09.400 --> 36:11.880
and it gradually lost power.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.580
This time, His Majesty

36:14.110 --> 36:16.400
sent Ye Xian to the Penal Court

36:16.510 --> 36:17.400
so

36:17.840 --> 36:19.070
he could

36:19.400 --> 36:20.550
take control of it

36:21.190 --> 36:23.150
on the Emperor's behalf,

36:24.000 --> 36:25.590
following the example of the late Emperor

36:25.590 --> 36:28.030
and restoring the Penal Court to power.

36:29.000 --> 36:30.730
Then, Mentor, what do you think

36:31.400 --> 36:32.230
of this?

36:38.550 --> 36:41.350
His Majesty wanting his own power

36:42.840 --> 36:44.070
is understandable.

36:46.230 --> 36:48.320
But the Commander of the Penal Court

36:48.320 --> 36:50.280
and the next Marquis Changxing

36:51.800 --> 36:54.000
must absolutely not be the same person.

36:58.230 --> 36:59.030
Therefore...

37:00.360 --> 37:01.070
Therefore,

37:01.550 --> 37:03.510
the title of Marquis Changxing

37:03.960 --> 37:05.490
can no longer be inherited.

37:08.580 --> 37:10.550
I understand.

37:14.150 --> 37:15.510
We need to take a long-term

37:15.510 --> 37:17.230
perspective on this matter.

37:17.440 --> 37:18.110
Look.

37:18.740 --> 37:21.140
The Marquis Changxing's Mansion just made

37:21.190 --> 37:23.150
a great contribution
in saving the Emperor.

37:23.150 --> 37:24.680
They are very powerful now.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.290
Don't make a move

37:27.110 --> 37:28.170
at this time.

37:29.840 --> 37:31.310
Just keep it in mind.

37:31.800 --> 37:32.230
Yes.

37:34.340 --> 37:35.150
By the way,

37:36.360 --> 37:38.110
my wife said the day before yesterday

37:38.110 --> 37:41.070
that she wanted to invite
the wives of the important officials

37:41.070 --> 37:42.230
over for a gathering.

37:42.230 --> 37:43.550
I just realized

37:44.230 --> 37:46.710
you are still single.

37:46.920 --> 37:48.610
It's my fault.

37:49.360 --> 37:51.920
I didn't think it through.

37:52.800 --> 37:54.700
You have joined the cabinet now.

37:54.760 --> 37:56.290
You can't be alone anymore.

37:56.760 --> 37:57.620
Someone must be

37:57.920 --> 37:59.650
by your side to take care of you.

38:02.030 --> 38:02.550
Well...

38:04.990 --> 38:07.620
[The Penal Court]

38:09.230 --> 38:09.840
My Lord.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.760
What is that smell?

38:13.760 --> 38:14.630
Young Master Ye

38:14.630 --> 38:15.960
found the dungeon's stench too strong,

38:15.960 --> 38:17.760
so he had incense lit all around.

38:19.000 --> 38:20.000
What does he think

38:20.000 --> 38:21.060
the Penal Court is?

38:21.280 --> 38:22.150
A brothel?

38:29.110 --> 38:30.030
Young Master Ye, if you

38:30.030 --> 38:30.920
can't even stand the smell

38:30.920 --> 38:31.880
of this dungeon,

38:32.440 --> 38:33.440
it only proves that you

38:33.440 --> 38:35.360
are not cut out for this line of work.

38:35.360 --> 38:37.000
You might as well report to His Majesty

38:37.000 --> 38:38.860
and leave this profession early.

38:40.510 --> 38:42.710
Commander Zhang, you just reminded me.

38:43.280 --> 38:44.360
From today on,

38:44.590 --> 38:45.440
move the interrogation room

38:45.440 --> 38:46.280
upstairs.

38:46.670 --> 38:47.150
You...

38:47.550 --> 38:49.080
I really don't like it here.

38:49.510 --> 38:50.960
There's not even a vent.

38:51.630 --> 38:53.160
But I like this line of work.

38:53.630 --> 38:55.030
I didn't think so before,

38:55.200 --> 38:56.780
but I suddenly realized

38:57.190 --> 38:58.850
this job is very educational.

38:58.960 --> 39:00.150
Educational?

39:01.510 --> 39:02.510
Did you know

39:02.670 --> 39:03.670
that human bones

39:03.840 --> 39:05.100
actually feel no pain?

39:05.440 --> 39:06.550
I just asked him.

39:07.190 --> 39:08.350
He said simply using a knife

39:08.350 --> 39:10.150
to scrape the bone doesn't hurt.

39:10.190 --> 39:12.030
It's the flesh that hurts.

39:14.670 --> 39:17.000
In the case of Prince Ruichang's treason,

39:17.110 --> 39:18.400
the principal offender
was already sentenced

39:18.400 --> 39:19.800
to be executed in autumn.

39:20.590 --> 39:22.700
Yet you had him sliced to death.

39:23.320 --> 39:24.610
Avenging a personal wrong
in the name of public interest,

39:24.610 --> 39:26.210
though understandable,

39:27.480 --> 39:28.150
still seems

39:28.150 --> 39:30.010
to go against the Emperor's will.

39:33.070 --> 39:35.070
Lord Zhang, you're quite eloquent.

39:35.960 --> 39:38.220
You're pinning two charges on me at once.

39:38.590 --> 39:40.070
But how do you know

39:40.280 --> 39:42.540
I wasn't acting under an imperial order?

39:42.630 --> 39:44.230
Where is the imperial order?

39:45.550 --> 39:47.550
If you don't believe me, Lord Zhang,

39:47.620 --> 39:49.420
I can take you to ask His Majesty.

39:54.020 --> 39:56.160
I was just joking.

39:57.110 --> 39:59.020
Young Master Ye, you're
deeply favored by His Majesty,

39:59.020 --> 40:00.250
as everyone knows.

40:00.590 --> 40:03.190
Naturally, you wouldn't
deceive the Emperor.

40:04.980 --> 40:06.740
I heard that you

40:07.150 --> 40:08.150
volunteered to raid the house of

40:08.150 --> 40:10.210
Yun Tao, Commander of the North City.

40:10.630 --> 40:12.120
If I remember correctly,

40:12.190 --> 40:14.840
I'm still in charge of this Penal Court.

40:15.840 --> 40:17.480
You didn't even inform me

40:17.630 --> 40:18.480
before asking His Majesty

40:18.480 --> 40:19.880
for this assignment.

40:20.360 --> 40:22.190
Isn't that a bit out of line?

40:24.400 --> 40:25.190
Out of line?

40:27.190 --> 40:28.480
Why don't I think so?

40:29.190 --> 40:30.630
You just said earlier

40:30.880 --> 40:32.880
that I'm avenging a personal wrong.

40:32.880 --> 40:34.530
Only by avenging a personal wrong

40:34.530 --> 40:36.050
can a raid be thorough.

40:36.360 --> 40:37.760
And only a thorough raid

40:38.280 --> 40:40.000
will please His Majesty, right?

40:40.000 --> 40:41.610
We all work for His Majesty.

40:41.670 --> 40:43.840
Don't be so petty, Lord Zhang.

40:44.550 --> 40:45.800
I even want to ask you

40:46.110 --> 40:47.400
for some good men.

40:51.480 --> 40:53.790
Then when do you plan to go?

40:55.110 --> 40:56.280
When?

40:56.550 --> 40:58.480
I really haven't thought about it.

40:59.150 --> 41:00.510
How about today?

41:00.670 --> 41:01.480
Today?

41:02.800 --> 41:03.800
It's a raid.

41:04.110 --> 41:04.800
Do we need to

41:04.800 --> 41:06.460
pick an auspicious day for it?

41:07.670 --> 41:08.190
Go.

41:08.800 --> 41:10.030
Gather the men

41:10.190 --> 41:10.990
and follow me.

41:12.070 --> 41:13.150
Yes, Commander Ye.

41:14.880 --> 41:15.880
Then, Lord Zhang,

41:16.130 --> 41:18.390
I'll go get busy.

41:23.110 --> 41:23.630
My Lord.

41:24.280 --> 41:25.510
His Majesty has just ascended the throne.

41:25.510 --> 41:26.340
Many real positions

41:26.340 --> 41:28.150
have been filled
with His Majesty's confidants.

41:28.150 --> 41:30.320
I'm afraid this Young Master Ye is also...

41:30.320 --> 41:32.480
He thinks he can replace me?

41:33.310 --> 41:35.620
It's still unknown who will win.

41:40.150 --> 41:41.320
At first,

41:41.410 --> 41:43.880
I thought people just visited
more often at the end of the year.

41:43.880 --> 41:45.320
Later, I found out

41:45.800 --> 41:48.070
that they were all
using visiting me as an excuse

41:48.070 --> 41:49.600
to play matchmaker for you.

41:50.290 --> 41:51.100
Look.

41:52.360 --> 41:55.110
This is Lord Gao's second daughter.

41:55.400 --> 41:57.780
This is Vice Minister Wang's
younger sister.

41:55.430 --> 41:56.680
[Respectfully submitted by Gao Zhongwen,
Minister of Ceremonial Affairs]

41:56.680 --> 41:57.110
[With deepest respect, Bai Chizheng,
Chancellor of the Imperial Academy]

41:57.130 --> 41:57.610
[To Madam Chen,
with respectful greetings]

41:58.320 --> 42:01.480
This is Chancellor Bai's eldest daughter.

42:02.440 --> 42:03.550
The three of them

42:04.190 --> 42:06.420
seem like a decent match for you.

42:07.230 --> 42:08.890
As for the rest girls

42:08.960 --> 42:11.440
from minor official or merchant families

42:11.590 --> 42:12.920
are not suitable.

42:13.630 --> 42:15.480
After all, your wife

42:15.760 --> 42:17.920
will be at least
a second-rank titled lady,

42:17.920 --> 42:19.550
and the wife of a Grand Secretary.

42:19.550 --> 42:21.000
In the future, she will have to

42:21.000 --> 42:23.030
handle social interactions for you.

42:23.030 --> 42:25.960
A woman from a humble family won't do.

42:40.960 --> 42:41.590
Chen Yi.

42:45.000 --> 42:45.800
Third Master.

42:47.470 --> 42:48.660
Go to the Gu family

42:49.360 --> 42:51.760
and ask if Miss Gu is available.

42:53.070 --> 42:53.800
Yes, My Lord.

43:09.180 --> 43:11.490
[Baoxiang Temple]

43:36.520 --> 43:40.090
[A Splendid Match]
